---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = 'Pantaloni cu snur lung | Ghid moda urbana complet';
const description = 'Ghid complet despre pantaloni cu snur lung, croieli moda urbana, materiale, marimi si link catre AtelierAXD. Vezi colectia!';
const canonical = 'https://pantalonicusnurlung.ro/pantaloni-cu-snur-lung/';
const image = '/pantaloni-barbati-largi-negri-snur-casual.jpg';
const schema = { '@context':'https://schema.org', '@type':'WebPage', name:title, url:canonical, image:new URL(image, canonical).href };
---
<Layout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical} image={image} type="website" schema={schema}>
<section id="hero"><div class="hero-bg"></div><div class="container"><div class="hero-inner-wrapper"><div class="hero-content"><div class="hero-badge">Ghid urban 2026</div><h1 class="hero-h1">Pantaloni cu<br/><span class="line2">snur lung.</span><br/>Ghid complet</h1><p class="hero-sub">Ghidul principal pentru pantaloni cu snur lung: croiala, material, talie elastica, snur vizibil, stilizare unisex si alegere rapida online.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a href="https://atelieraxd.ro/collections/pantaloni-barbati-atelier-axd" class="btn-primary">Vezi colectia</a><a href="/ghid-marimi-pantaloni-cu-snur" class="btn-ghost">Ghid marimi</a></div></div></div><div class="hero-stats"><div class="hero-stat"><div class="stat-num">100<span>%</span></div><div class="stat-label">Calitate superioara</div></div><div class="hero-stat"><div class="stat-num">Unisex</div><div class="stat-label">Purtat si de femei</div></div><div class="hero-stat"><div class="stat-num">1-3<span>zile</span></div><div class="stat-label">Timp livrare</div></div><div class="hero-stat"><div class="stat-num">Card</div><div class="stat-label">sau ramburs</div></div></div></div></section><section class="section" id="colectie"><div class="container"><div class="services-header reveal"><div><span class="section-tag">// Magazin niche</span><h2 class="section-h2">Alege modelul de <em>pantaloni</em> preferat</h2></div><p class="section-lead">Selectam si comercializam croieli moda urbana cautate, disponibile prin AtelierAXD, cu accent pe pantaloni cu snur lung, negru, lejer si unisex.</p></div><div class="services-grid"><a class="service-card  reveal " href="https://atelieraxd.ro/collections/pantaloni-barbati-atelier-axd"><div class="service-arrow">-></div><div class="card-img-wrap"><img src="/pantaloni-barbati-largi-negri-snur-casual.jpg" alt="Pantaloni barbati largi negri snur casual" title="Pantaloni barbati largi negri snur casual" width="1200" height="1600" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" /></div><div class="service-name">Pantaloni barbati largi negri snur casual</div><div class="service-desc">Croiala lejera potrivita pentru un aspect relaxat. Echilibru intre moda urbana si casual, purtat usor de baieti si fete.</div><div class="service-tags"><span class="tag">Popular</span><span class="tag">Unisex lejer</span></div></a><a class="service-card  reveal reveal-delay-1" href="https://atelieraxd.ro/collections/pantaloni-barbati-atelier-axd"><div class="service-arrow">-></div><div class="card-img-wrap"><img src="/pantaloni-barbati-negri-snur-lung.jpg" alt="Pantaloni barbati negri snur lung" title="Pantaloni barbati negri snur lung" width="1200" height="1600" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div><div class="service-name">Pantaloni barbati negri snur lung</div><div class="service-desc">Varianta clasica reinventata, cu material durabil, asezare buna pe incaltaminte sport si snur lung vizibil.</div><div class="service-tags"><span class="tag">Croiala clasica</span><span class="tag">Selectie</span></div></a><a class="service-card  reveal " href="https://atelieraxd.ro/collections/pantaloni-barbati-atelier-axd"><div class="service-arrow">-></div><div class="card-img-wrap"><img src="/pantaloni-scurti-negri-cu-snur-lung.jpg" alt="Pantaloni scurti negri cu snur lung" title="Pantaloni scurti negri cu snur lung" width="1200" height="1600" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div><div class="service-name">Pantaloni scurti negri cu snur lung</div><div class="service-desc">Pentru sezonul cald: acelasi impact vizual moda urbana intr-o pereche scurta si confortabila.</div><div class="service-tags"><span class="tag">Vara</span><span class="tag">Scurti</span></div></a><a class="service-card  reveal reveal-delay-1" href="https://atelieraxd.ro/collections/pantaloni-barbati-atelier-axd"><div class="service-arrow">-></div><div class="card-img-wrap"><img src="/pantaloni-negri-scurti-snur-lung.jpg" alt="Pantaloni negri scurti snur lung" title="Pantaloni negri scurti snur lung" width="1200" height="1600" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div><div class="service-name">Pantaloni negri scurti snur lung</div><div class="service-desc">Alternativa pentru zile de vara petrecute in oras, cu material placut si croiala lejera.</div><div class="service-tags"><span class="tag">Croiala de vara</span><span class="tag">Urban</span></div></a><a class="service-card  reveal " href="https://atelieraxd.ro/collections/pantaloni-barbati-atelier-axd"><div class="service-arrow">-></div><div class="card-img-wrap"><img src="/pantaloni-negri-oversized-barbati-snur-lung.jpg" alt="Pantaloni negri oversized barbati snur lung" title="Pantaloni negri oversized barbati snur lung" width="1200" height="1600" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div><div class="service-name">Pantaloni negri oversized barbati snur lung</div><div class="service-desc">Larg, masiv, pur moda urbana. Pentru look foarte larg inspirat din cultura urbana internationala.</div><div class="service-tags"><span class="tag">Oversized</span><span class="tag">Larg</span></div></a><a class="service-card  reveal reveal-delay-1" href="https://atelieraxd.ro/collections/pantaloni-barbati-atelier-axd"><div class="service-arrow">-></div><div class="card-img-wrap"><img src="/pantaloni-negri-slim-snur-lung-atelieraxd.jpg" alt="Pantaloni negri slim snur lung AtelierAXD" title="Pantaloni negri slim snur lung AtelierAXD" width="1200" height="1600" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div><div class="service-name">Pantaloni negri slim snur lung AtelierAXD</div><div class="service-desc">Croiala slim selectata pentru asezare mai apropiata de corp, pastrand detaliul urban al snurului lung.</div><div class="service-tags"><span class="tag">Croiala slim</span><span class="tag">AtelierAXD</span></div></a></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="split-grid"><article class="content-panel reveal"><h2>Croiala potrivita</h2><p>Pantaloni cu snur lung pot fi loose, oversized sau slim. Modelele largi dau volum si atitudine, iar cele slim pastreaza o linie mai curata.</p></article><article class="content-panel reveal"><h2>Material si confort</h2><p>Alege materiale cu tinuta buna, talie elastica stabila si snur lung rezistent. Diferenta se simte la purtare zilnica.</p></article><article class="content-panel reveal"><h2>Cum ii porti</h2><p>Merg cu tricouri oversized, incaltaminte sport masiva, hanorace si piese simple. Contrastul dintre negru si snurul alb ramane detaliul central.</p></article><article class="content-panel reveal"><h2>Unde ii cumperi</h2><p>Pentru achizitie, CTA-ul principal trimite catre colectia AtelierAXD de pantaloni cu snur lung.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="section" id="lookbook"><div class="container"><div class="services-header reveal"><div><span class="section-tag">// Purtat si de ea</span><h2 class="section-h2">Croiala de barbati? Mai degraba <em>unisex.</em></h2></div><p class="section-lead">Desi multe modele vin din zona moda masculina, croielile lejere si snurul lung le fac potrivite si pentru tinute feminine, moda urbana si relaxate.</p></div><div class="lookbook-grid reveal reveal-delay-1"><figure class="lookbook-item"><img src="/pantaloni-femei-streetwear-snur-lung.png" alt="Tinuta urbana dama cu pantaloni cu snur lung" title="Tinuta urbana dama" width="1080" height="1440" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><figcaption class="lookbook-overlay"><span class="lookbook-title">Tinuta urbana dama</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="lookbook-item"><img src="/tinuta-unisex-pantaloni-largi-snur-extra-lung.png" alt="Tinuta unisex cu pantaloni largi si snur extra lung" title="Croiala unisex" width="1080" height="1440" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><figcaption class="lookbook-overlay"><span class="lookbook-title">Croiala unisex</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="lookbook-item"><img src="/outfit-casual-tricou-pantaloni-negri-snur-lung.png" alt="Tinuta casual cu tricou si pantaloni negri cu snur lung" title="Casual urban" width="1080" height="1440" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><figcaption class="lookbook-overlay"><span class="lookbook-title">Casual urban</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="lookbook-item"><img src="/pantaloni-baggy-fete-snur-lung-atelieraxd.png" alt="Pantaloni baggy pentru fete cu snur lung AtelierAXD" title="Stil baggy" width="1080" height="1440" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><figcaption class="lookbook-overlay"><span class="lookbook-title">Stil baggy</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="lookbook-item"><img src="/detaliu-snur-lung-pantaloni-oversized-dama.png" alt="Detaliu snur lung la pantaloni oversized de dama" title="Detalii oversized" width="1080" height="1440" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><figcaption class="lookbook-overlay"><span class="lookbook-title">Detalii oversized</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="lookbook-item"><img src="/moda-urbana-pantaloni-unisex-cu-snur-lung.png" alt="Moda urbana cu pantaloni unisex cu snur lung" title="Moda urbana" width="1080" height="1440" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><figcaption class="lookbook-overlay"><span class="lookbook-title">Moda urbana</span></figcaption></figure></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="content-panel reveal" style="text-align:center"><span class="section-tag">// cumpara acum</span><h2 class="section-h2" style="margin:0 auto 18px">Pantaloni cu snur lung AtelierAXD</h2><p style="max-width:640px;margin:0 auto 26px">Daca ai ales stilul, mergi direct in magazin pentru modele disponibile, plata si livrare.</p><a href="https://atelieraxd.ro/collections/pantaloni-barbati-atelier-axd" class="btn-primary">pantaloni cu snur lung atelieraxd</a></div></div></section></Layout>
